+### Implementation Patterns (Adapter Interactions)
+
+| Concern | Specification |
+|---------|--------------|
+| **Parameter binding** | asyncpg: `$1, $2` positional; SQLAlchemy async: `:name` named. Phase 8 picks one. |
+| **Error handling** | All DB calls wrapped in try/except; `asyncpg.UniqueViolationError` on duplicate `target_request_id` → log + skip (idempotent re-submit). All other DB errors → log + re-raise. |
+| **Query generation** | Parameterized only. No f-string interpolation. |
+| **Pagination** | Not applicable — report queries are by ID or by status (small result sets). |
