+## 10. API Endpoints
+
+Base path: `/api/v1/reports`
+
+### POST `/api/v1/reports/requests`
+
+**Purpose:** Submit a new report request to Target.
+**Idempotent:** No (creates a new request each call).
+**Unknown fields:** Reject (422) via `extra="forbid"`.
+
+| Field | Type | Required | Description |
+|-------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `report_type` | string | Yes | Must match `registry.yaml` entry |
+| `start_date` | string (ISO 8601) | Per registry config | Required if `start_date_required: true` |
+| `end_date` | string (ISO 8601) | Per registry config | Required if `end_date_required: true` |
+
+**Response:** `201 Created` → `ReportRequestResponse`
+**Errors:**
+- `422` — Unknown report type, unknown fields, missing required date
+- `502` — Target API returned error on POST
+
+### GET `/api/v1/reports/requests/{request_id}`
+
+**Purpose:** Get status of a report request.
+**Idempotent:** Yes.
+**Resource missing:** 404.
+
+**Response:** `200 OK` → `ReportRequestResponse`
+
+### GET `/api/v1/reports/requests/{request_id}/document`
+
+**Purpose:** Get downloaded report document content.
+**Idempotent:** Yes.
+**Resource missing:** 404 (request not found or no document yet).
+
+**Response:** `200 OK` → `{ "content": <JSONB payload>, "storage_status": "STORED", "content_size_bytes": N }`
+**Errors:**
+- `404` — No document exists (still polling, or download failed)
+- `410` — `storage_status = DOCUMENT_TOO_LARGE` (payload was not stored)
+
+### GET `/api/v1/reports/types`
+
+**Purpose:** List registered report types from registry.
+**Idempotent:** Yes.
+
+**Response:** `200 OK` → `[{ "type": "ALLOWED_ITEM_TYPES", "format": "JSON", "description": "..." }]`
+
+### HTTP Method Semantics
+
+| Endpoint | Method | Idempotent | Missing Resource | Unknown Fields |
+|----------|--------|-----------|------------------|----------------|
+| `/requests` | POST | No | N/A (creates) | Reject 422 |
+| `/requests/{id}` | GET | Yes | 404 | N/A |
+| `/requests/{id}/document` | GET | Yes | 404 / 410 | N/A |
+| `/types` | GET | Yes | N/A (always exists) | N/A |
