+## 12. Operational Readiness
+
+### Health Checks
+
+| Endpoint | Checks | Response |
+|----------|--------|----------|
+| `GET /health` | Process alive | `200 {"status": "ok"}` |
+| `GET /health/ready` | Postgres connection + registry loaded | `200 {"status": "ready", "postgres": "ok", "registry": "ok"}` / `503` if degraded |
+
+### Structured Logging
+
+All log events emit JSON with:
+
+| Field | Source |
+|-------|--------|
+| `timestamp` | ISO 8601 UTC |
+| `level` | INFO/WARNING/ERROR |
+| `logger` | Module name (`app.reports.lifecycle`) |
+| `trace_id` | Request correlation ID (from middleware) |
+| `report_request_id` | When available |
+| `report_type` | When available |
+| `event` | Human-readable event name (`report_request_created`, `poll_cycle_complete`, `download_started`) |
+
+### Metrics (Prometheus)
+
+| Metric | Type | Labels |
+|--------|------|--------|
+| `target_report_requests_total` | Counter | `report_type`, `status` |
+| `target_report_poll_duration_seconds` | Histogram | `report_type` |
+| `target_report_download_bytes` | Histogram | `report_type` |
+| `target_report_active_polls` | Gauge | — |
+
+### Alerting Conditions
+
+| Condition | Severity | Threshold |
+|-----------|----------|-----------|
+| `FAILED` rate > 50% over 1h | Warning | Investigate Target API health |
+| `UNRECOGNIZED_STATUS` count > 0 | Warning | Target may have added new status values; update lifecycle mapping |
+| `DOCUMENT_TOO_LARGE` count > 0 | Info | Review `max_document_bytes` setting |
+| Poll loop not running (gauge = 0 for > 10 min when PENDING rows exist) | Critical | Process may have crashed without sweep |
+
