+
+## 13. External API Rate Limits
+
+| Endpoint | Known Limit | Strategy |
+|----------|------------|----------|
+| `POST /report_requests` | Unknown (OQ-017-4) | Conservative: max 1 concurrent create per seller_id |
+| `GET /report_requests/{id}` | Unknown (OQ-017-4) | Poll interval from registry config (default 10s); exponential backoff on 429 |
+| `GET <download_url>` | Unknown | Single attempt; retry once on 5xx with 5s delay |
+
+### 429 Handling
+
+On HTTP 429 from any Target endpoint:
+1. Read `Retry-After` header if present; sleep that duration
+2. If no `Retry-After`: exponential backoff starting at 30s, max 5 min
+3. Log warning with `trace_id` and endpoint
+4. After 3 consecutive 429s: mark request `FAILED` with error message "Rate limited by Target"
+
