+## 14. Async Hazards Checklist
+
+| SDK/Library | Sync or Async? | Wrapping Strategy |
+|-------------|----------------|-------------------|
+| httpx | Native async (`httpx.AsyncClient`) | No wrapping needed |
+| asyncpg | Native async | No wrapping needed |
+| SQLAlchemy (if used) | Async via `create_async_engine` | No wrapping needed |
+| PyYAML (`yaml.safe_load`) | Sync | Runs once at startup; no wrapping needed (blocks event loop <1ms) |
+| `json.loads` | Sync | CPU-bound for large payloads; wrap in `asyncio.to_thread()` if `content_size_bytes > 1MB` |
