+- [x] Can a new developer understand this in their first week? Yes — linear flow, no magic, clear state machine.
+
+---
+
+*Produced by Phase 6 Systems Architect, STORY-017. Selected Approach A per analysis.md. No HTTP calls made. All design defaults are conservative; STORY-007 outputs will refine polling intervals, payload size limits, and Target status enum values.*
