+### Gate 2b: tgtrt Credential Redaction
+All 4 tests in `test_tgtrt_redacted.py` pass. `_redact_auth_on_log` event hook strips `tgtrt`, `Authorization`, and `x-api-key` to `***REDACTED***` before debug logging. Wire delivery confirmed separately.
